---
pagination:
  data: companyIndex.typeCountries
  size: 1
  alias: tc
  # Zonder dit komt alleen de EERSTE pagina van de reeks in collections.all,
  # en dus maar een van de honderden in sitemap.xml.
  addAllPagesToCollections: true
permalink: "{{ tc.url }}"
layout: layout.njk
# llms.txt is een samenvatting, geen sitemap: de combinatie- en stadspagina's
# blijven eruit, de hub, de drie types en de landen staan er wel in.
excludeFromLlms: true
eleventyComputed:
  title: "{{ tc.label }} in {{ tc.inCountry }}"
  seo_title: "{{ tc.label }} in {{ tc.inCountry }}: {{ tc.count }} Listed | Tubes"
  description: "{{ tc.count }} {{ tc.label | lower }} in {{ tc.inCountry }}, each verified on its own website, with services, credits and facilities as published."
---
{#- Combinatiepagina "type in land". Alleen gemaakt vanaf companyIndex.minCombo
    bedrijven: met een of twee is zo'n pagina te dun om te laten indexeren. -#}
<article class="section theme-light company-page">
  <div class="container company-inner has-promo">
    <div class="company-main">
    <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
      <a href="/">Home</a> <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
      <a href="/companies/">Companies</a> <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
      <a href="{{ tc.typeUrl }}">{{ tc.label }}</a> <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
      <span aria-current="page">{{ tc.country }}</span>
    </nav>
    <header class="company-head">
      <p class="company-kicker"><a href="{{ tc.typeUrl }}">{{ tc.label }}</a></p>
      <h1>{{ tc.label }} in {{ tc.inCountry }}</h1>
      <p class="company-summary">{{ tc.count }} listed in {{ tc.inCountry }}, each checked on its own website. See <a href="{{ tc.countryUrl }}">every kind of company in {{ tc.inCountry }}</a>, or filter and compare in the <a href="/compare-media-production-companies/">search tool</a>.</p>
    </header>
    {#- Reclameblok: op smalle schermen hier, anders in de zijkolom onderaan. -#}
    {% set promoVariant = "inline" %}{% include "partials/company-promo.njk" %}

    {% set lijst = tc.companies %}{% set toonLand = false %}{% set toonSpecialisme = true %}{% set meer = 0 %}
    {% include "partials/company-links.njk" %}

    <p class="company-back">
      <a href="{{ tc.countryUrl }}">All companies in {{ tc.inCountry }}</a> &middot;
      <a href="{{ tc.typeUrl }}">All {{ tc.label | lower }} in Europe</a> &middot;
      <a href="/companies/">Directory</a>
    </p>
    </div>
    <div class="guide-side">{% set promoVariant = "aside" %}{% include "partials/company-promo.njk" %}</div>
  </div>
</article>

<section class="section theme-teal">
  <div class="container company-cta">
    <h2>Producing in {{ tc.inCountry }}?</h2>
    <p>Tubes brings budgeting, planning and cost control together in one platform, so a co-production or a service shoot becomes a working budget instead of a guess.</p>
    <p><a class="button button-primary" href="/contact/">Request a Demo</a></p>
  </div>
</section>
